  {kind="narration",pos=233.047,dur=11.576,name="NARRATION 009 | When Angela entered our community, she presented herself a",text="When Angela entered our community, she presented herself as a protector of vulnerable people—someone who fought for abused women and children and stood up to bullies.",path="",status="NARRATION RECORDING REQUIRED",line=80},
