  {kind="narration",pos=3263.962,dur=10.925,name="NARRATION 145 | Angela gave more than one explanation for the disclosures.",text="Angela gave more than one explanation for the disclosures. One involved the insult in my room. Another involved her claim that she was confronting abuse.",path="",status="NARRATION RECORDING REQUIRED",line=614},
  {kind="narration",pos=3275.187,dur=11.576,name="NARRATION 146 | In a separate September 8 conversation, she said something",text="In a separate September 8 conversation, she said something I'd told her had triggered her, and that she had sent a screenshot to prove me wrong.",path="",status="NARRATION RECORDING REQUIRED",line=616},
