  {kind="archive_angela",pos=3290.425,dur=42.3,name="ARCHIVE C43 AQ-0270 | 046__AQ-0270__Triggered_Sent_Screenshot.wav",text="Manuscript line 619\n[CLIP #113 | AQ-0270 | *Hook Line Sinker* (20260908_1nGeLMjONkAKX), Sept 8, 2026, 3450.0s]\nManifest status: existing\nAudio cut boundaries/context and speaker NOT independently verified. Audition before publication.\nOriginal source: C:\\Users\\Logan\\OneDrive\\Documents\\AngelaMaster\\media\\AQ-0270_Angela_Maggard.wav",path="C:\\Users\\Logan\\copy-spaces-to-youtube-pipeline\\papertrail_archival_audio_ordered\\046__AQ-0270__Triggered_Sent_Screenshot.wav",status="existing",line=619},
  {kind="narration",pos=3333.005,dur=3.468,name="NARRATION 148 | Taken together, those accounts describe an escalation.",text="Taken together, those accounts describe an escalation.",path="",status="NARRATION RECORDING REQUIRED",line=624},
  {kind="narration",pos=3336.773,dur=14.494,name="NARRATION 149 | First, Sav says private screenshots were shared against he",text="First, Sav says private screenshots were shared against her wishes in August. By September 2, I was already saying publicly that Angela had posted screenshots, though that recording doesn't identify precisely which ones.",path="",status="NARRATION RECORDING REQUIRED",line=626},
  {kind="narration",pos=3351.567,dur=12.061,name="NARRATION 150 | Then, on September 8, Angela made the release itself the s",text="Then, on September 8, Angela made the release itself the subject of a broadcast. She announced batches of four and said she'd keep more messages in reserve.",path="",status="NARRATION RECORDING REQUIRED",line=628},
  {kind="narration",pos=3363.928,dur=15.305,name="NARRATION 151 | We still can't reconstruct a single first disclosure from ",text="We still can't reconstruct a single first disclosure from those accounts. But we can hear the progression from a private breach of trust to a public campaign, and the explanations Angela gave along the way.",path="",status="NARRATION RECORDING REQUIRED",line=630},
  {kind="narration",pos=3379.533,dur=7.522,name="NARRATION 152 | There was one more warning in *Petty Space* about just how",text="There was one more warning in *Petty Space* about just how far she was prepared to go.",path="",status="NARRATION RECORDING REQUIRED",line=632},
  {kind="archive_angela",pos=3387.355,dur=18.024,name="ARCHIVE C44 AQ-0166 | 047__AQ-0166__Share_Every_DM_Back_To_2023.mp3",text="Manuscript line 633\n[CLIP #166 | *Petty Space* (20260908_1wxWjlrwXokJQ), Sept 8, 2026, 14:23]\nManifest status: extracted\nAudio cut boundaries/context and speaker NOT independently verified. Audition before publication.\nOriginal source: D:\\Angela Project\\audio_source\\20260908_1wxWjlrwXokJQ_Petty_Space.mp3",path="C:\\Users\\Logan\\copy-spaces-to-youtube-pipeline\\papertrail_archival_audio_ordered\\047__AQ-0166__Share_Every_DM_Back_To_2023.mp3",status="extracted",line=633},
  {kind="narration",pos=3405.659,dur=11.171,name="NARRATION 153 | That is an extraordinary amount of leverage for someone to",text="That is an extraordinary amount of leverage for someone to hold over former friends: years of direct messages, waiting to be published if the argument escalates.",path="",status="NARRATION RECORDING REQUIRED",line=638},
  {kind="narration",pos=3417.129,dur=11.656,name="NARRATION 154 | And the screenshots were not the only way the private rela",text="And the screenshots were not the only way the private relationship became public. Angela was also beginning to describe me in terms that could ruin a reputation.",path="",status="NARRATION RECORDING REQUIRED",line=640},
  {kind="narration",pos=3429.585,dur=11.656,name="NARRATION 155 | Angela accused me of abusing women and called me a predato",text="Angela accused me of abusing women and called me a predator. She also accused me of passing around women's nude photographs and creating sexual AI material.",path="",status="NARRATION RECORDING REQUIRED",line=647},
  {kind="narration",pos=3441.541,dur=14.899,name="NARRATION 156 | I want to examine those claims because the consequences re",text="I want to examine those claims because the consequences reached beyond me. Sav had shared private concerns with Angela about our relationship; now those conversations were being used in the public case Angela was making.",path="",status="NARRATION RECORDING REQUIRED",line=649},
  {kind="narration",pos=3456.741,dur=15.71,name="NARRATION 157 | Earlier, in an unrelated February dispute about Mellow Dem",text="Earlier, in an unrelated February dispute about Mellow Demon and an AI image, you heard Angela warn against a male witch hunt. She said serious labels should be reserved for real abusers, not used to settle scores.",path="",status="NARRATION RECORDING REQUIRED",line=651},
  {kind="narration",pos=3472.751,dur=10.034,name="NARRATION 158 | Months later, on September 7, she explained why she someti",text="Months later, on September 7, she explained why she sometimes chose the word *predator* instead of *pedophile*. The distinction she drew was deliberate.",path="",status="NARRATION RECORDING REQUIRED",line=653},
