  {kind="narration",pos=3617.654,dur=9.629,name="NARRATION 164 | But there was a woman who knew the context behind at least",text="But there was a woman who knew the context behind at least one of the photographs Angela was discussing. It was Sav.",path="",status="NARRATION RECORDING REQUIRED",line=685},
  {kind="narration",pos=3627.583,dur=21.951,name="NARRATION 165 | Sav says a lingerie selfie of Lin had circulated publicly ",text="Sav says a lingerie selfie of Lin had circulated publicly after Lin's sister posted it from Lin's phone. Months later, Sav heard about it and felt jealous and insecure. She asked me to show her the image because she feared it might be a nude. I sent it to her.",path="",status="NARRATION RECORDING REQUIRED",line=687},
  {kind="narration",pos=3649.834,dur=8.818,name="NARRATION 166 | She told Angela about the exchange during a private conver",text="She told Angela about the exchange during a private conversation between friends. She says Angela understood why it upset her.",path="",status="NARRATION RECORDING REQUIRED",line=689},
