  {kind="sfx",pos=3672.164,dur=0.12,name="SFX 10 | SFX: Subtle phone tactile send click",text="SFX: Subtle phone tactile send click",path="C:\\Users\\Logan\\copy-spaces-to-youtube-pipeline\\THE_PAPER_TRAIL_REAPER_ASSEMBLY_20261112\\SCRATCH_phone_send_click.wav",status="SCRATCH - replace before release",line=694},
  {kind="reading",pos=3672.164,dur=40.567,name="WRITTEN READING 002 | \"Angela, you know that picture of Lin sent to me was becau",text="\"Angela, you know that picture of Lin sent to me was because I asked him to show me the proof of it. Not him just willingly spreading around this picture... I was also sending you because I trusted you that it wouldn't come back that I sent it to you... It wasn’t him spreading around Lin’s nude. She did that herself. It was literally to reassure me she wasn’t nude like I thought she was. Framing it as if he was going around spreading the picture just isn’t what happened... Like, at all.\"",path="",status="RECORDING REQUIRED",line=698},
  {kind="sfx",pos=3713.03,dur=0.12,name="SFX 11 | SFX: Subtle phone tactile send click",text="SFX: Subtle phone tactile send click",path="C:\\Users\\Logan\\copy-spaces-to-youtube-pipeline\\THE_PAPER_TRAIL_REAPER_ASSEMBLY_20261112\\SCRATCH_phone_send_click.wav",status="SCRATCH - replace before release",line=698},
  {kind="narration",pos=3713.03,dur=14.494,name="NARRATION 169 | Sav didn't pretend that she'd been calm or confident about",text="Sav didn't pretend that she'd been calm or confident about the photograph. She was telling Angela something more specific: she had asked to see it, and she had trusted Angela with why.",path="",status="NARRATION RECORDING REQUIRED",line=702},
  {kind="narration",pos=3727.824,dur=8.413,name="NARRATION 170 | A few hours later, she sent another message. This one asks",text="A few hours later, she sent another message. This one asks the question at the heart of the story.",path="",status="NARRATION RECORDING REQUIRED",line=704},
  {kind="sfx",pos=3736.537,dur=0.12,name="SFX 12 | SFX: Subtle phone tactile send click",text="SFX: Subtle phone tactile send click",path="C:\\Users\\Logan\\copy-spaces-to-youtube-pipeline\\THE_PAPER_TRAIL_REAPER_ASSEMBLY_20261112\\SCRATCH_phone_send_click.wav",status="SCRATCH - replace before release",line=705},
  {kind="reading",pos=3736.537,dur=32.798,name="WRITTEN READING 003 | \"What friend weaponizes that when I'm coming to you TALKIN",text="\"What friend weaponizes that when I'm coming to you TALKING about me being insecure about it?!? How are you going to now lay it out like it’s some sick pass around the nudes of people? ... Lin has stated that shit was made public by her, she willingly spread it around. And then went up and defended Logan that he WASNT spreading it. He was showing his girlfriend she wasn't nude she was in lingerie.\"",path="",status="RECORDING REQUIRED",line=709},
