  {kind="narration",pos=3842.25,dur=11.656,name="NARRATION 175 | I haven't independently examined that underlying image for",text="I haven't independently examined that underlying image for this documentary. So while my admission is on tape, the description of whom it depicted remains my account.",path="",status="NARRATION RECORDING REQUIRED",line=735},
  {kind="narration",pos=3854.206,dur=15.305,name="NARRATION 176 | But this was a separate incident from the lingerie photogr",text="But this was a separate incident from the lingerie photograph Sav asked me to show her. It doesn't establish that Sav's photograph was a nude, or that she'd never asked to see it.",path="",status="NARRATION RECORDING REQUIRED",line=737},
