  {kind="sfx",pos=3887.887,dur=0.12,name="SFX 18 | SFX: Subtle phone tactile send click",text="SFX: Subtle phone tactile send click",path="C:\\Users\\Logan\\copy-spaces-to-youtube-pipeline\\THE_PAPER_TRAIL_REAPER_ASSEMBLY_20261112\\SCRATCH_phone_send_click.wav",status="SCRATCH - replace before release",line=742},
  {kind="reading",pos=3887.887,dur=15.753,name="WRITTEN READING 006 | \"Angela what is the goal here.....? Are we going after you",text="\"Angela what is the goal here.....? Are we going after your voice being taken or something else entirely? What exactly is your goal here with this stuff? Where is the evidence for any of it?\"",path="",status="RECORDING REQUIRED",line=746},
  {kind="sfx",pos=3903.94,dur=0.12,name="SFX 19 | SFX: Subtle phone tactile send click",text="SFX: Subtle phone tactile send click",path="C:\\Users\\Logan\\copy-spaces-to-youtube-pipeline\\THE_PAPER_TRAIL_REAPER_ASSEMBLY_20261112\\SCRATCH_phone_send_click.wav",status="SCRATCH - replace before release",line=746},
  {kind="narration",pos=3903.94,dur=9.144,name="NARRATION 179 | The person whose insecurities had been discussed privately",text="The person whose insecurities had been discussed privately was now asking for the evidence and the purpose of the whole campaign.",path="",status="NARRATION RECORDING REQUIRED",line=750},
  {kind="narration",pos=3913.383,dur=11.656,name="NARRATION 180 | That is what made these broadcasts more than a fight betwe",text="That is what made these broadcasts more than a fight between Angela and me. Sav was trying to correct the public account of her own private life.",path="",status="NARRATION RECORDING REQUIRED",line=752},
