  {kind="narration",pos=4202.328,dur=15.71,name="NARRATION 199 | But the welfare call and what happened to information from",text="But the welfare call and what happened to information from that day are two different questions. What did it mean to protect somebody when the most intimate details of their crisis could later enter an escalating argument?",path="",status="NARRATION RECORDING REQUIRED",line=830},
  {kind="narration",pos=4218.338,dur=14.088,name="NARRATION 200 | On September 18, Sav spoke publicly. She acknowledged her ",text="On September 18, Sav spoke publicly. She acknowledged her own insecurity and involvement in private gossip, but she also asked listeners to understand what it felt like to have her personal life exposed.",path="",status="NARRATION RECORDING REQUIRED",line=832},
