  {kind="narration",pos=4389.212,dur=8.738,name="NARRATION 202 | That is Sav describing how people caught up in an online c",text="That is Sav describing how people caught up in an online conflict ended up carrying consequences in their real lives.",path="",status="NARRATION RECORDING REQUIRED",line=846},
  {kind="narration",pos=4398.25,dur=13.683,name="NARRATION 203 | Then on September 30, Angela hosted a Space about the soci",text="Then on September 30, Angela hosted a Space about the social cost of taking a suicide threat seriously. She spoke about the possibility that authorities or family members might encounter the messages.",path="",status="NARRATION RECORDING REQUIRED",line=848},
  {kind="archive_angela",pos=4412.233,dur=6.0,name="ARCHIVE C54 AQ-0033 | 058__AQ-0033__CPS_Husband_Not_My_Responsibility.wav",text="Manuscript line 849\n[CLIP #024 | AQ-0033 | *The Social Cost of Taking a Suicide Threat Seriously* (20260930_1lJQRWLvWVzxE), Sept 30, 2026, 1106.9s]\nManifest status: existing\nAudio cut boundaries/context and speaker NOT independently verified. Audition before publication.\nOriginal source: C:\\Users\\Logan\\Downloads\\sav\\angela\\24_CPS_Husband_Not_My_Responsibility.wav",path="C:\\Users\\Logan\\copy-spaces-to-youtube-pipeline\\papertrail_archival_audio_ordered\\058__AQ-0033__CPS_Husband_Not_My_Responsibility.wav",status="existing",line=849},
  {kind="narration",pos=4418.513,dur=2.657,name="NARRATION 204 | That is her public position.",text="That is her public position.",path="",status="NARRATION RECORDING REQUIRED",line=854},
  {kind="narration",pos=4421.47,dur=13.603,name="NARRATION 205 | What appeared in a later private group chat needs to be co",text="What appeared in a later private group chat needs to be considered separately, because those messages went further—and the identity of the person operating the account has not been independently confirmed.",path="",status="NARRATION RECORDING REQUIRED",line=856},
  {kind="narration",pos=4435.873,dur=6.711,name="NARRATION 206 | The screenshots show a conversation in a women's group cha",text="The screenshots show a conversation in a women's group chat, with a Monday-morning timestamp.",path="",status="NARRATION RECORDING REQUIRED",line=863},
  {kind="narration",pos=4442.884,dur=17.006,name="NARRATION 207 | The account on the screen is labelled “Angela's Spaces Alt",text="The account on the screen is labelled “Angela's Spaces Alt.” That is what the screenshots show; the account label alone does not prove who was typing. The exact calendar date is also not printed in the visible morning exchange.",path="",status="NARRATION RECORDING REQUIRED",line=865},
  {kind="narration",pos=4460.19,dur=11.251,name="NARRATION 208 | I want you to understand the distinction before you hear t",text="I want you to understand the distinction before you hear the words. This is a reading of written messages, not an authenticated recording of Angela speaking.",path="",status="NARRATION RECORDING REQUIRED",line=867},
  {kind="narration",pos=4471.741,dur=10.765,name="NARRATION 209 | At 6:35 in the morning, the labelled account discussed a r",text="At 6:35 in the morning, the labelled account discussed a recording of Sav while she was in distress, with her children in the background.",path="",status="NARRATION RECORDING REQUIRED",line=869},
  {kind="reading",pos=4482.806,dur=25.951,name="WRITTEN READING 007 | \"And first and foremost, I have you talking about killing ",text="\"And first and foremost, I have you talking about killing yourself on recording with your kids screaming in the background and you’re sitting here trying to intimidate me and trying to make me not feel bad for teaching you that every action has a reaction. If you want me to hold the fuck back, shut the fuck up, you dumb bitch.\"",path="",status="RECORDING REQUIRED",line=876},
  {kind="reading",pos=4509.058,dur=14.779,name="WRITTEN READING 008 | \"I’m not canceling anything do you understand and when c p",text="\"I’m not canceling anything do you understand and when c p s gets hold of that video? Because of the proper mandatory reporter that I sent it to, that’s not my issue. Fuck off\"",path="",status="RECORDING REQUIRED",line=881},
  {kind="reading",pos=4524.136,dur=10.975,name="WRITTEN READING 009 | \"And I don’t give a fuck if you can’t afford to pay the da",text="\"And I don’t give a fuck if you can’t afford to pay the damages, I just want you under the stress that you’ve caused me.\"",path="",status="RECORDING REQUIRED",line=886},
  {kind="narration",pos=4535.411,dur=15.79,name="NARRATION 210 | There are two different things happening in those messages",text="There are two different things happening in those messages. The discussion of a video and Child Protective Services appears in one exchange. The line about wanting someone under stress appears in a separate discussion of civil damages.",path="",status="NARRATION RECORDING REQUIRED",line=889},
  {kind="narration",pos=4551.501,dur=12.872,name="NARRATION 211 | We cannot fairly take that line about damages as proof tha",text="We cannot fairly take that line about damages as proof that anybody planned to misuse CPS. And the messages, however disturbing, do not themselves establish that a report was made.",path="",status="NARRATION RECORDING REQUIRED",line=891},
  {kind="narration",pos=4564.673,dur=11.251,name="NARRATION 212 | But the earlier words raise a serious question. A private ",text="But the earlier words raise a serious question. A private crisis involving Sav and her children was being discussed as material that could reach outside authorities.",path="",status="NARRATION RECORDING REQUIRED",line=893},
  {kind="narration",pos=4576.224,dur=14.088,name="NARRATION 213 | At 6:50, Sav's side of the chat accused Angela of threaten",text="At 6:50, Sav's side of the chat accused Angela of threatening to send information to her parents. The reply from the account labelled Angela's Spaces Alt reads like a warning.",path="",status="NARRATION RECORDING REQUIRED",line=895},
  {kind="reading",pos=4590.612,dur=5.102,name="WRITTEN READING 010 | \"Send it to my parents Angela like you threatened ya loser",text="\"Send it to my parents Angela like you threatened ya loser\"",path="",status="RECORDING REQUIRED",line=899},
  {kind="reading",pos=4596.014,dur=11.135,name="WRITTEN READING 011 | \"Maybe I should. Maybe I should stop talking about it. And",text="\"Maybe I should. Maybe I should stop talking about it. And just be about it, right? That’s the only way you’re gonna learn a lesson\"",path="",status="RECORDING REQUIRED",line=904},
  {kind="narration",pos=4607.449,dur=8.738,name="NARRATION 214 | Those screenshots don't prove who authored the account's r",text="Those screenshots don't prove who authored the account's reply or whether anyone contacted Sav's parents that morning.",path="",status="NARRATION RECORDING REQUIRED",line=907},
  {kind="narration",pos=4616.487,dur=20.249,name="NARRATION 215 | But Sav provided a separate written account of what she sa",text="But Sav provided a separate written account of what she says happened outside the app. She named her ex, her father and her uncle as people Angela contacted. Sav says those relatives came to her asking why Angela was telling them alarming things about her and her family.",path="",status="NARRATION RECORDING REQUIRED",line=909},
  {kind="narration",pos=4637.037,dur=13.763,name="NARRATION 216 | And then Sav described the practical cost. These were some",text="And then Sav described the practical cost. These were some of the people she depended on most. According to her account, they threatened to withdraw their support if she continued participating online.",path="",status="NARRATION RECORDING REQUIRED",line=911},
  {kind="narration",pos=4651.099,dur=11.656,name="NARRATION 217 | She was already navigating a separation and questions of c",text="She was already navigating a separation and questions of custody. Sav says the contacts also raised accusations that she wasn't fit to care for her children.",path="",status="NARRATION RECORDING REQUIRED",line=913},
  {kind="narration",pos=4663.055,dur=19.439,name="NARRATION 218 | I haven't independently confirmed each call or the message",text="I haven't independently confirmed each call or the messages passed along. These are Sav's descriptions of what she experienced. But the consequences she's describing are painfully specific: the possible loss of family support, and fear over how the accusations might affect her children.",path="",status="NARRATION RECORDING REQUIRED",line=915},
  {kind="narration",pos=4682.794,dur=12.061,name="NARRATION 219 | I remember how shaken Sav sounded when we spoke on the pho",text="I remember how shaken Sav sounded when we spoke on the phone around that period. That's my recollection, not another recorded call I can play for you.",path="",status="NARRATION RECORDING REQUIRED",line=917},
  {kind="direction",pos=4695.155,dur=0.5,name="PAUSE | [beat]",text="[beat]",path="",status="TIMING GUIDE",line=918},
  {kind="narration",pos=4695.655,dur=15.71,name="NARRATION 220 | If Sav's account is accurate, the stakes of confiding in A",text="If Sav's account is accurate, the stakes of confiding in Angela were no longer just whether a screenshot would be posted in a public room. They extended to the people Sav relied on outside the internet.",path="",status="NARRATION RECORDING REQUIRED",line=921},
  {kind="narration",pos=4711.665,dur=14.819,name="NARRATION 221 | And that is the part of this story I find hardest to dismi",text="And that is the part of this story I find hardest to dismiss: the very circumstances that made people seek somebody's help could, after a falling-out, become the details they most feared being exposed.",path="",status="NARRATION RECORDING REQUIRED",line=923},
  {kind="ambience",pos=4727.285,dur=3.0,name="AMBIENCE 20 | SFX: Actual room tone. No music.",text="SFX: Actual room tone. No music.",path="",status="CUE ONLY - AUDIO NOT SELECTED",line=928},
  {kind="narration",pos=4727.285,dur=3.873,name="NARRATION 222 | Think about the people who entered this story.",text="Think about the people who entered this story.",path="",status="NARRATION RECORDING REQUIRED",line=932},
  {kind="narration",pos=4731.458,dur=10.845,name="NARRATION 223 | Sine believed he was sending survivors to an advocate. Lat",text="Sine believed he was sending survivors to an advocate. Later, he said he feared he had been directing them toward someone who would target them.",path="",status="NARRATION RECORDING REQUIRED",line=934},
  {kind="narration",pos=4742.603,dur=12.467,name="NARRATION 224 | Glow Baby and Timmy described friendships that, in their t",text="Glow Baby and Timmy described friendships that, in their telling, led to threats and private family information being used in disputes. Some of those claims still lack independent corroboration.",path="",status="NARRATION RECORDING REQUIRED",line=936},
  {kind="narration",pos=4755.37,dur=16.521,name="NARRATION 225 | Sav believed she had a friend she could be honest with abo",text="Sav believed she had a friend she could be honest with about motherhood, insecurity and a life that was coming apart. Then she heard private details from that life recast in public, and said the conflict reached her family.",path="",status="NARRATION RECORDING REQUIRED",line=938},
  {kind="narration",pos=4772.191,dur=1.9,name="NARRATION 226 | And Angela?",text="And Angela?",path="",status="NARRATION RECORDING REQUIRED",line=940},
  {kind="narration",pos=4774.391,dur=12.387,name="NARRATION 227 | In her own recordings, she described gathering information",text="In her own recordings, she described gathering information before approaching people, saving screenshots, keeping names and documents in reserve, and helping expose information when she believed she was justified.",path="",status="NARRATION RECORDING REQUIRED",line=942},
  {kind="narration",pos=4787.077,dur=10.925,name="NARRATION 228 | She also said there were limits. She said you shouldn't re",text="She also said there were limits. She said you shouldn't release something just to twist the knife. She said some evidence could be weaponized.",path="",status="NARRATION RECORDING REQUIRED",line=944},
  {kind="narration",pos=4798.302,dur=5.495,name="NARRATION 229 | Then she described the point where she decided to release ",text="Then she described the point where she decided to release it anyway.",path="",status="NARRATION RECORDING REQUIRED",line=946},
  {kind="narration",pos=4804.097,dur=16.601,name="NARRATION 230 | I can't tell you everything Angela believed. I can't turn ",text="I can't tell you everything Angela believed. I can't turn every accusation made about her into an established fact. But I can put the explanations she gave beside what the people who trusted her say they experienced.",path="",status="NARRATION RECORDING REQUIRED",line=948},
  {kind="narration",pos=4820.998,dur=12.952,name="NARRATION 231 | That was the promise of this investigation. Not that a mic",text="That was the promise of this investigation. Not that a microphone can read somebody's mind. That the words people choose—and the consequences others describe—can be heard together.",path="",status="NARRATION RECORDING REQUIRED",line=950},
  {kind="narration",pos=4834.25,dur=11.251,name="NARRATION 232 | Angela once invited listeners to do exactly that. To belie",text="Angela once invited listeners to do exactly that. To believe the good things they heard about her, and the bad, and make up their own minds.",path="",status="NARRATION RECORDING REQUIRED",line=952},
  {kind="narration",pos=4845.801,dur=3.468,name="NARRATION 233 | I'll leave you with her invitation.",text="I'll leave you with her invitation.",path="",status="NARRATION RECORDING REQUIRED",line=954},
  {kind="archive_angela",pos=4849.569,dur=40.3,name="ARCHIVE C55 AQ-0271 | 059__AQ-0271__Hook_Line_Sinker_Closing.wav",text="Manuscript line 955\n[CLIP #171 | AQ-0271 | *Hook Line Sinker* (20260908_1nGeLMjONkAKX), Sept 8, 2026, 60:30 / 3635.0s]\nManifest status: existing\nAudio cut boundaries/context and speaker NOT independently verified. Audition before publication.\nOriginal source: C:\\Users\\Logan\\OneDrive\\Documents\\AngelaMaster\\media\\AQ-0271_Angela_Maggard.wav",path="C:\\Users\\Logan\\copy-spaces-to-youtube-pipeline\\papertrail_archival_audio_ordered\\059__AQ-0271__Hook_Line_Sinker_Closing.wav",status="existing",line=955},
